---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const steps = [
  { name: 'Understand', icon: 'search', text: 'Start with the problem. Ask better questions.' },
  { name: 'Shape', icon: 'pen', text: 'Make the complex feel clear and intuitive.' },
  { name: 'Build', icon: 'code', text: 'Connect thoughtful interfaces to solid systems.' },
  { name: 'Refine', icon: 'launch', text: 'Test the details. Keep making it better.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero" id="intro" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-topline"><span>INDEPENDENT THINKING. CONNECTED SYSTEMS.</span><span class="status-label"><i></i> OPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES</span></div>
    <div class="hero-masthead" aria-hidden="true">PORTFOLIO</div>
    <div class="portrait-stage"><img class="hero-cutout" src={`${base}images/molinda-cutout.png`} alt="Molinda Mihiranga" width="1122" height="1402" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>
    <div class="hero-intro">
      <span class="hero-greeting">Hello, I’m</span>
      <h1 id="hero-title">MOLINDA<br />MIHIRANGA<span>.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-role">SOFTWARE ENGINEER<br />&amp; CURIOUS BUILDER.</p>
      <p class="hero-description">Thoughtful on the surface.<br />Solid underneath. I build software<br class="desktop-break" /> that brings the two together.</p>
      <a class="hero-work-link" href="#work"><span>EXPLORE MY WORK</span><span class="circle-arrow"><Icon name="down" size={19} /></span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-side">
      <div class="hero-note"><span class="orbit-star"><Icon name="spark" size={27} /></span><p>From a first idea<br />to something<br /><em>that works.</em></p></div>
      <dl class="hero-stats"><div><dt>05</dt><dd>SELECTED<br />PROJECTS</dd></div><div><dt>06</dt><dd>MONTHS AT<br />RAXWO</dd></div><div><dt>IT</dt><dd>UNDERGRADUATE<br />AT SLIIT</dd></div></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottomline"><span><Icon name="globe" size={14} /> BASED IN SRI LANKA · BUILDING BEYOND BORDERS</span><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER <Icon name="down" size={13} /></span></div>
  </section>

  <div class="discipline-strip" aria-label="Areas of work"><span>FULL-STACK DEVELOPMENT</span><Icon name="spark" size={16} /><span>MOBILE EXPERIENCES</span><Icon name="spark" size={16} /><span>AI &amp; CONNECTED SYSTEMS</span><Icon name="spark" size={16} /><span>IDEAS INTO REALITY</span></div>

  <section class="selected-work section-shell" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span>01 /</span> THE WORK</p><h2 id="work-title">SELECTED <em>WORK.</em></h2></div><p>Different problems. One approach.<br />Build something useful, and build it well.</p><span class="section-count">( 01—05 )</span></div>
    <div class="showcase-grid">{projects.map((project, index) => {
      const phone = project.visual === 'hydro' || project.visual === 'spendwise';
      const shots = (project.screenshots ?? []).slice(0, phone ? 2 : 1);
      return <article class:list={['showcase-card', 'reveal', { 'showcase-featured': index === 0, 'showcase-secondary': index === 1 }]}>
        <a href={`${base}projects/${project.slug}/`} class="showcase-link" aria-label={`Explore ${project.title}: ${project.eyebrow}`}>
          <div class={`showcase-visual showcase-${project.visual}`}>
            <div class="showcase-top"><span>{project.eyebrow}</span><span class="visual-link-icon"><Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></span></div>
            <span class="showcase-word" aria-hidden="true">{project.title}</span>
            <div class:list={['project-art', { 'phone-art': phone, 'desktop-art': !phone }]}>{shots.map(shot => <div class={phone ? 'phone-frame' : 'browser-frame'}>{!phone && <div class="browser-chrome" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>{project.title.toLowerCase()} / workspace</span></div>}<img src={`${base}${shot.src}`} alt={shot.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>)}</div>
            <span class="visual-footnote">{phone ? 'MOBILE EXPERIENCE' : 'WEB PLATFORM'} <span>↗</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="showcase-caption"><span class="project-number">{project.number}</span><div><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.category}</p></div><Icon name="right" size={26} /></div>
        </a>
      </article>;
    })}</div>
    <div class="work-endnote"><span>REAL PROJECTS. REAL SCREENS. END-TO-END THINKING.</span><a href="https://github.com/MolindaMihiranga17" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MORE ON GITHUB <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="about section-shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-intro reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span>02 /</span> BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2 id="about-title">A CURIOUS MIND.<br /><em>A PRACTICAL BUILDER.</em></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Molinda, a software engineer and IT undergraduate at SLIIT. I enjoy the space where a good idea meets the details that make it work.</p><p>From multi-tenant platforms at Raxwo to AI recruitment and connected agriculture, I work across the interface, the API, and everything underneath.</p><a class="inline-link" href={`${base}resume/Molinda-Mihiranga-CV.pdf`} download>DOWNLOAD MY CV <Icon name="download" size={17} /></a></div></div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="credentials reveal"><h3>THE FOUNDATION<span>01</span></h3><div class="credential"><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE <span>APR — OCT 2026</span></p><h4>Software Engineering Intern</h4><p>Raxwo Pvt Ltd · Remote, Sri Lanka</p><div class="experience-links"><a href={`${base}projects/gymora/`}>Gymora <Icon name="arrow" size={12} /></a><a href={`${base}projects/raxwolms/`}>RaxwoLMS <Icon name="arrow" size={12} /></a></div></div><div class="credential"><p class="eyebrow">EDUCATION <span>2022 — PRESENT</span></p><h4>BSc in Information Technology</h4><p>Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology</p></div><div class="skills-block"><p class="eyebrow">TOOLS OF THE TRADE</p><div class="skill-tags">{['React', 'Next.js', 'TypeScript', 'React Native', 'Go', 'Python', 'ASP.NET Core', 'PostgreSQL', 'Docker', 'AWS'].map(skill => <span>{skill}</span>)}</div></div></div>
      <div class="process reveal"><h3>THE PROCESS<span>02</span></h3><ol>{steps.map((step, index) => <li><span class="process-number">0{index + 1}</span><span class="process-icon"><Icon name={step.icon} size={21} /></span><div><h4>{step.name}</h4><p>{step.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol></div>
      <aside class="manifesto reveal"><Icon name="spark" size={57} /><p>FROM<br /><span>“WHAT IF”</span><br />TO<br /><span>“IT WORKS.”</span></p><div><span class="signature">Molinda</span><span class="manifesto-note">THAT’S THE PART<br />I LOVE.</span></div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact section-shell" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="contact-topline"><p class="eyebrow"><span>03 /</span> THE NEXT CHAPTER</p><span class="status-label"><i></i> OPEN TO A CONVERSATION</span></div>
    <div class="contact-main"><div class="contact-title-wrap reveal"><h2 id="contact-title">LET’S MAKE<br /><em>IT HAPPEN.</em></h2><Icon name="spark" size={64} class="contact-star" /></div><div class="contact-info reveal"><p>A project, an opportunity, or a good idea.<br />It all starts with a conversation.</p><a class="email-link" href="mailto:molindamihiranga17@gmail.com"><span>molindamihiranga17<br />@gmail.com</span><Icon name="arrow" size={31} /></a><div class="contact-actions"><button class="copy-email" type="button" data-email="molindamihiranga17@gmail.com"><Icon name="copy" size={15} /><span>COPY EMAIL</span></button><span class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="social-links"><a href="https://github.com/MolindaMihiranga17" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/molinda-mihiranga-627789317" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LINKEDIN <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></a><a href={`${base}resume/Molinda-Mihiranga-CV.pdf`} download>RESUMÉ <Icon name="download" size={14} /></a></div></div></div>
    <div class="contact-bottomline"><span>BASED IN SRI LANKA. ALWAYS CURIOUS.</span><span>GOOD THINGS START SOMEWHERE. <Icon name="right" size={19} /></span></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
